pipeline. Additionally, a XLSX file with supplementary table is provided. This file contains all the literature used to curate the prior knowledge network, included in added notes within the XLSX file. See Appendix for descriptions of the tables. \n \n **Master overview** <br/>\n <img src=\"https://github.com/Bi-rong/ActiveLearning_MechanisticModels_CXCL9/blob/main/visual/master_overview.png\" width=\"1000\">"}]}